# System-X11 and libx11-compat Mosaic hyperlink differential capture.
#
# Keep this replay focused on externally driven input and screenshots. Pixel
# similarity is evaluated by the differential comparison after both captures.
delay 3000
# 15 second wait-window: the parallel differential scaffold runs two
# Xvfb instances and two captures concurrently, so Mosaic startup
# contends with the system-side Motif build and can drift past the
# 5 second budget that worked for the single-Xvfb smoke job.
wait-window "Mosaic|NCSA" 15000
delay 5000
screenshot initial
assert-image initial common-visible.json
motion 80 178
button 1 click
delay 3000
screenshot linked
assert-image linked common-visible.json
